they can be um but you know i think at a certain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:23.760
point you also need to know when to walk away&nbsp;
like you know at a certain point you need to say&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:28.560
